{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WASTELAND WARRIORS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the dust-choked heart of the dead earth, where hope goes to die and bullets sing louder than prayers, walk the Warriors. Not heroes. Not soldiers. Just hardwired survivors with iron wills, rusted armor, and vendettas older than the sunburnt skyline.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612940/extras/473bbf8637f18e9a5643ddaef723459d.avif?t=1754668405\" width=616 height=102 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Auto-firing/targeting drone mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hundreds of items and weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 player Co-Op locally</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive 5 days worth of waves (from 30-60 seconds)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After day 5, test your build in Endless Mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique characters with different stats to enhance builds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hit the shop in between waves to buy different Drones and Items</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to take on the apocalypse? Grab your friends and prepare for battle in <strong>Wasteland Warriors!</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3612940?t=1754668405","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612940/ff7b58e7acb5d1b414fb7858b1b5e4d9ec79db98/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1754668405","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612940/c21e6a9c19ad9eed0f0766a7dd5