argeting drone mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hundreds of items and weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 player Co-Op locally</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive 5 days worth of waves (from 30-60 seconds)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After day 5, test your build in Endless Mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique characters with different stats to enhance builds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hit the shop in between waves to buy different Drones and Items</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to take on the apocalypse? Grab your friends and prepare for battle in <strong>Wasteland Warriors!</strong></p>","developers":["2DPK Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612940/711c1468b27c7cf72f344fdf01778bf31aec583f/header.jpg?t=1754668405","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 11 Big Sur<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5 (6th Gen or newer) or Apple M1/M2<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> AMD Radeon Pro 560 / Intel Iris Plus Graphics 650/Apple M1 or M2 Integrated GPU</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3612940/421211202/01bb7698ffd8488c3d8af49e1d645e6c291672ae/1754346281/dash_av1.mpd?t=1754349225","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3612940/421211202/01bb7698ffd8488c3d8af49e1d645e6c291672ae/1754346281/dash_h264.mpd?t=1754349225","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.aka